Z||000002||Mach10||10-28-2001||09:26 PM||||Ignore this clown  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Everyone's welcome. This forum's a place for Fiero FANS, not necessarily owners. Some people in the past have come here to start stuff, and they tend to get ostracized... Don't start any flame wars here, and you'll make plenty of friends!<P>Welcome!<BR>If you have any questions, feel free to post 'em in the appropriate section. However, I do recommend trying the search function, as it's most likely that one of us 3500 users has had the same problem!<P>Again, Welcome!||||reg||10
Z||000003||maryjane||10-28-2001||09:41 PM||||Welcome aboard. As Mach10 (watch him, he's a trouble-maker) said, we are a peaceful, tolerant bunch. Never a cross word or sarcastic comment to anybody, irregardless of what they say or believe. I'm a pacifist myself. The 'bs' smiley is so seldom used, it has cobwebs on it when it's  taken out accasionally to make sure it's  still operational. Yep, peace, love, harmony. That's what we're about. Rules are: read the rules-follow the rules. You'll like it here! You will amaze your friends and influence co-workers with new found knowledge. Like I say, welcome to PFF.||||reg||12
